flowchart TB
    Admin[Engineer / Core UI] --> Core[Core Backend: IAM, Registry, Policy]
    Core <-->|Versioned internal HTTP contracts| OpAMPServer[Go OpAMP Server adapter]
    Mock[Go Mock Core / isolated testbed] <-->|Same contracts in tests| OpAMPServer
    OpAMPServer <-->|Native OpAMP| OTelSupervisor[OTel OpAMP Supervisor]
    Core <-->|Enrollment and business APIs| Agent[AR-IMMS Agent]
    Core <-->|Separate authorized operations transport| Operations[Remote Operations]
    subgraph Host[Windows / Linux Host]
      Agent -->|Provision / local config| OTelSupervisor
      Agent --> Configuration[Agent Configuration & Policy]
      Docker[Docker + host metadata] --> Inventory[Discovery Providers / Metadata Registry]
      Inventory --> Monitoring[Monitoring Capabilities / Provisioner]
      Monitoring --> Configuration
      Configuration -.->|Current runtime until parity; transfer once| OTelSupervisor
      OTelSupervisor -->|sole process owner after transfer| OTel[OTel Collector]
      Docker --> Observer[OTel Docker/Host Observer]
      Observer --> Creator[OTel Receiver Creator]
      Creator --> Receivers[OTel Receivers]
      OTel --> Receivers
      State[(SQLite durable state)] <--> Configuration
      State <--> Inventory
      Events[Typed events - advisory] -.-> Monitoring
      Events -.-> OTelSupervisor
      Health[Health & Reporting] --> Agent
      OTel -.->|diagnostic evidence| Health
    end
    Receivers --> Gateway[OTLP Gateway / Metrics Logs Traces]
